      }
    },
    "$description": "The stacking scale. Each layer's NUMBER lives once, in z.values.<name>.$value; the @property registration's initial-value is DERIVED from it by the generator, so the registration and the :root declaration cannot disagree. A registration may carry an `initial` field, but it must equal the layer's value or the generator refuses to run."
  },
